### Enterprise Legal RAG Platform - Search & Retrieval API
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Hybrid Semantic & Exact Keyword Search
# @name semanticSearch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "termination notice period days for convenience",
  "top_k": 3,
  "min_score": 0.25,
  "enable_hybrid": true
}

### 2. Search With Clause Metadata Filtering
# @name filteredSearch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "governing law jurisdiction",
  "top_k": 2,
  "min_score": 0.30
}

### 3. Search Validation Scenario: Query Too Short / Empty
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "",
  "top_k": 5
}

### 4. Search Validation Scenario: Top-K Out of Bounds
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "valid search query",
  "top_k": 250
}
